' 12. SOLIDITY'S TWO GIANTS. foundry 275 MB (unpinned nightly; forge+cast+anvil+
'     chisel) and semgrep 377 MB via `pip --break-system-packages` into Debian's
'     dist-packages. Both unpinned, in the image the fleet's own doctrine says must
'     be. defs/claudecode/solidity/Dockerfile:10,19 · ~100-200 MB
'
' 13. `--with-deps` APT-INSTALLS ~100 GTK/X11/ALSA PACKAGES for a headless,
'     `--no-sandbox`, CDP-only consumer. It is also invisible to
'     `toolchain_test.go`'s `installedPackages` scanner, so the "no image reinstalls
'     what its base carries" contract has a blind spot exactly where the biggest apt
'     payload is. defs/base-node-browser/Dockerfile:10 · ~120-180 MB x 3
'
' WHAT A HARNESS PULL LOOKS LIKE WITH 1-9 APPLIED:
'   opencode          2.19 GB -> -394 MB  (-18%)
'   opencode-browser  3.98 GB -> -728 MB  (-18%)
'   cecli             2.88 GB -> -641 MB  (-22%)
'
' ── MEASURED, AND DELIBERATELY NOT ON THE LIST ─────────────────────────────
' Three plausible wins that the instruments killed, recorded so nobody re-derives them:
'   dpkg path-exclude for docs/man/locale — /usr/share/doc is **5.2 MB** on this
'     base. debian-slim already excludes them. Nothing to win.
'   the agents' own npm packages — claude-code 206 MB and opencode-ai 176 MB look
'     like they ship a duplicate binary (bin/*.exe AND node_modules/*-linux-arm64).
'     They are HARDLINKS: `du` counts the payload once and so does the layer.
'   cursor's installer leftovers — /opt/cursor-dist is 514 MB with NO cache or
'     archive left behind. It is three real payloads: cursor-agent-sea 135 MB,
'     -worker-sea 144 MB, and a bundled node 126 MB. Nothing to reclaim; note only
'     that under inversion that bundled node becomes a SECOND node in the image.
'
' ── CORRECTNESS FOUND ALONGSIDE, WHICH THE SIZE WORK MUST NOT BURY ─────────
' (a) DOCKERD. claudecode/mcp:57-90 says "Static docker CLI only" and spends 20
'     lines concluding that shipping dockerd makes sbx attempt a start that fails
'     and BLOCKS THE WHOLE SANDBOX. Line 88 then installs the whole tarball, :89
'     symlinks /usr/bin/dockerd, :105 sets start-docker=true. cursor, opencode and
'     cecli carry the opposite comment ("the whole static tarball, not just the
'     client"). One of the two is stale; nothing in the tree says which.
' (b) `LABEL security.hardened=true` IS FALSE IN EVERY HARNESS. proveo-harden's own
'     header says every layer that installs extras re-runs the pass; the last
'     binary-adding layers never do — cecli:105, opencode:69 and :97, cursor:73 and
'     :105, claudecode/mcp:90,112,120,135,178 — and solidity never runs it at all
'     while inheriting the label.
' (c) UNPINNED INSTALLS the repo's own doctrine (_spec/_devops/agent-version-pin.puml)
'     forbids: all six LSP servers (base-node-lsp:5-11), both `go install ...@latest`
